I totally agree with you on reflection, I just prioritize finding a
non-amulet source of reflection much higher than you do. ESP is not
that valuable to me; I like it but it comes from plenty of the quest
artifacts I tend to wish for anyway, and I'd rather have lifesaving
personally. Telepathy with a blindfold or even just used occasionally
when some monster sees fit to blind me is sufficient for my playstyle.

I have ascended at least once or twice wearing an amulet of reflection,
and it went just fine; I just get itchy if I don't have lifesaving by
the late game. Maybe it's not a necessary habit, but I don't think it's
a bad one.

